<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Introduction</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">This Privacy Policy explains how Zunkiree Labs collects, uses, and protects information when you visit our website.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Depending on your interaction with our website, we may collect information that you voluntarily provide as well as basic technical information required to operate the website.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">How We Use Information</h2>

